<title>ARGENTINA: Telefonica Argentina Q1 EPS $0.05.</title>
<headline>Telefonica Argentina Q1 EPS $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Dec 31</p>
<p>EPS $0.05 vs n/a</p>
<p>Earnings per ADS $0.45 vs n/a</p>
<p>Net income $106.5 million vs n/a</p>
<p>Revenues $724.9 million vs $677.8 million.</p>
<p>Notes: Telefonica de Argentina SA later said net income for Q1 1995 was $107.5 million.</p>
<p>Investment in property, plant, equipment and materials totalled $178.5 million vs $249.4 million.</p>
<p>((--David Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0652))</p>
